<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Ms. Muster, what drives you?</strong></p><p>Curiosity drives me. I have worked in banking for twenty years and still learn something every day.</p><figure class="wp-block-image"><img class="wp-image-102" src="https://stgallenbusinessreview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/chart-1024x600.png" alt="Chart"></figure><p><strong>What is next?</strong></p><p>We will see what the future of the industry brings for all of us.</p><p><strong>Thank you?</strong></p><p>Thank you.</p>]]></content:encoded><excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
